        "1.17.1-2.1.7":"- Fix NPE on getMaxCapacity(). Close #9. Thanks to AnCasper for the report.\r\n- Added a way to check if an ingredient match while ignoring the ingredient amount\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.7"
