		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.18":"- Added compatibility with Create 6.0.6\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.21.0.247\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-88\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.115.1\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.152\r\n- Updated gradle to version 8.10\r\n- Updated NeoGradle to version 7.0.183\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.18"
		,
