        ,
        "1.18.1-2.0.42":"- Fix multiblock assembly in corer cases before opt2 is merged in\r\n- Added back support for Mekanism in 1.18.2\r\n- Updated Forge to version 40.1.0\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 10.2.0.459\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.100.4\r\n- Updated JEI to version 9.7.0.100\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.16\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.42\r\n"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.44":"- Added Enderium Block from FTB Industrial Contraptions to the forge:storage_blocks/enderium so it can be used as a moderator\r\n- Typo. Close #82\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.18.2-2.1.17 to fix a crash when an error is displayed on the screen\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.44"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.45":"- Added three new Moderators for your Reactors as a nod to the past!\r\n- The Fluidizer recipes now accepts non-reactants ingredients\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.45"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.49":"- Added a button in the Reprocessor Controller GUI to void all fluids in the internal tank\r\n- Fixed a couple of errors in da book. Close #90, thanks to aharrisw for the report\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.49"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.51":"- API: names of named objects should respect the rules for ResourceLocations\r\n- API: added colour information to coolants and vapors\r\n- Added to the JEI plugin : reactants reactions, reactants solid/fluid mappings, coolants <=> vapors transitions, coolants and vapors mappings\r\n- Fixed icons in the Fluidizer JEI recipe category\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to 2.1.22\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.51"
